ake your opponent  Flinch you have already won  you can only fight the way you practice  if you do not control the enemy the  enemy will control you  [Music]  the important thing in strategy is to  suppress the enemy's useful actions but  allow his useless actions  [Music]  the only reason a warrior is alive is to  fight and the only reason a warrior  fights is to win  to become the enemy see yourself as the  enemy of the enemy  [Music]  know your enemy know his sword  when your opponent is hurrying  recklessly you must act contrarily and  keep calm you must not be influenced by  the opponent  one must make the warrior walk his  everyday walk  [Music]  in strategy it is important to see  distant things as if they were close  and to take a distant view of close  things  [Music]  in strategy it is necessary to treat  training as part of normal life with  your spirit unchanging foreign  the purpose of today's training is to  defeat yesterday's understanding  [Music]  study strategy over the years and  achieve the spirit of the warrior  [Music]  the path that leads to truth is littered  with the bodies of the ignorant  you win battles by knowing the enemy's  timing and by using timing that the  enemy does not anticipate  [Music]  in time all things work to your  advantage when you pursue them with an  open heart  if you do not look at things on a large  scale it will be difficult to master  strategy  [Music]  even if a man has no natural ability he  can be a warrior  foreign  [Music]  there are many ways of understanding  simple ideas but generally the opposite  is true of difficult ideas  when you attack the enemy your spirit  must go to the extent of pulling the  stakes out of the wall and using them as  Spears and halberds  it is bad to repeat the same thing  several times when fighting the enemy  foreign  do not collect weapons or practice with  weapons beyond what is useful  [Music]  no man is Invincible therefore no man  can fully understand that which would  make